## Title: ShieldFrames
## Notes: Overshield overlay for Blizzard party and raid frames.|n|nReplaces the default right-edge glow with a transparent bar that extends left across the health bar, sized to the real overshield amount. Works with default compact party and raid frames only.|n|nRequires Interface > Raid Frames > Display Incoming Heals.|nType /shieldframes or /sf for settings.
